					|Trước khi thay đổi tùy chỉnh, cần bật sử dụng lưu kết quả thực hiện quy tắc trong tùy chỉnh của mỗi quy tắc nhận thực tế theo dạng ngân sách theo dữ liệu của kế toán hoạt động';
					|ru = 'Поддержка новых операций прекращена с версии 2.5.26.
					|Перед изменением настройки необходимо включить хранение результата выполнения правила в настройках каждого правила получения факта по статьям бюджетов по данным оперативного учета';
					|en = 'No longer supports new business transactions from version 2.5.26.
					|Before changing the setting, enable storing of the rule execution result in the settings of each actual data receipt rule by budget flow items according to the operational accounting data'; fa = 'No longer supports new business transactions from version 2.5.26.
					|Before changing the setting, enable storing of the rule execution result in the settings of each actual data receipt rule by budget flow items according to the operational accounting data';
					|it = 'No longer supports new business transactions from version 2.5.26.
					|Before changing the setting, enable storing of the rule execution result in the settings of each actual data receipt rule by budget flow items according to the operational accounting data';
					|pl = 'No longer supports new business transactions from version 2.5.26.
					|Before changing the setting, enable storing of the rule execution result in the settings of each actual data receipt rule by budget flow items according to the operational accounting data';
					|tr = '2.5.26 sürümünden itibaren yeni işlemlerin desteği sonlandırılmıştır. 
					| Ayarı değiştirmeden önce, operasyonel muhasebe verilerine dayalı bütçe kalemlerinin her bir gerçek veri alma kuralı ayarında, kural yürütme sonucunun saklanmasını etkinleştirmek gerekir.'");
